# Files under the assets directory (= repo root, see wrangler.jsonc) that
# Cloudflare must NOT upload. gitignore syntax; the file itself is not served.

# --- Build-breaking: must never be uploaded ------------------------------
# The build clones the repo into the assets directory, so wrangler walks
# .git too and dies on the pack file (139 MiB vs the 25 MiB per-asset
# limit). This is what failed every build on main.
.git/
.wrangler/
node_modules/
# Local-only video masters (gitignored, so absent on the builder) — listed
# so `npx wrangler deploy --dry-run` works as a pre-push check.
assets/videos/

# --- Staged, not yet published -------------------------------------------
# Interna Wissensraum media. Referenced only by interna.html, which is behind
# the session gate; while these are excluded that page shows missing media.
# Delete these three lines to publish them.
assets/audio/
assets/grundtoene/
assets/uebungen/

# --- Repo-internal: never part of the published site ---------------------
# The Worker serves the repo root verbatim, so anything not listed here is
# publicly fetchable by URL.
.assetsignore
.gitignore
.claude/
.specify/
specs/
files/
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
README.md
serve.py
wrangler.jsonc
*.pdf
